concept:crimes-amendment-strengthening-the-criminal-justice-response-to-sexual-violence-act-2024-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 After paragraph 15Y(2)(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (bd) an offence against Division 274 of the Criminal Code (torture); (bi) an offence against any of the following arising under section 6 of the Crimes at Sea Act 2000: (i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 114, 2024 Crimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to Sexual Violence) Act 2024 (iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (bj) an offence against section 14 or 15 of the Crimes (Aviation) Act 1991 arising under any of the following: (i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (bk) an aggravated offence against Subdivision C of Division 12 of Part 2 of the Migration Act 1958; (bl) a sexual offence specified in the regulations;" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (bd) an offence against Division 274 of the Criminal Code (torture); (bi) an offence against any of the following arising under section 6 of the Crimes at Sea Act 2000: (i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT);  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 114, 2024 Crimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to Sexual Violence) Act 2024 (iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (bj) an offence against section 14 or 15 of the Crimes (Aviation) Act 1991 arising under any of the following: (i) Part 3 (Sexual offences) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (ii) Part 3A (Intimate image abuse) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (iii) Part 4 (Female genital mutilation) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (iv) Part 5 (Sexual servitude) of the Crimes Act 1900 (ACT); (bk) an aggravated offence against Subdivision C of Division 12 of Part 2 of the Migration Act 1958; (bl) a sexual offence specified in the regulations;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cad3ad24cffdc7ec6b309b3e44b2081b2f9e7aed55e05e0e93ed602c23f84e9c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inserts new offences against torture, sexual image abuse, female genital mutilation, and sexual servitude." ;
