    values:originalText "Despite the amendments made by this Schedule, Part IAD of the Crimes Act 1914, as in force immediately before the commencement of this Schedule, continues to apply in relation to a proceeding begun, but not completed, before that commencement.  Crimes Amendment (Strengthening the Criminal Justice Response to Sexual Violence) Act 2024 No. 114, 2024 [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 7 February 2024 Senate on 26 February 2024] (3/24)" ;
